GIVETH AN EITHER `A problem with the facts` (LIST OF `A person's child allowance for the month`)
`ind one child away` d ab inst MEANS
    `ind at chosen` (`ind single` d (`ind resident` "P") (LIST `ind child full` "away" (YMD 2016 1 1) FALSE (JUST ab) inst (LIST `ind natural mother` "P" TRUE)))
