-- D7: the same, the Institute regards the child as in Israel: counted.
#ASSERT `ind total` "P" (`ind one child away` (YMD 2026 3 1) (`ind absence` (YMD 2025 11 10) NOTHING) TRUE) EQUALS JUST 150

